 "fra-16": {
  "title": "Speed shadow run: dip14 with shred fire in SHADOW + clock2 + feed-lag + defer + skip Rakurai; M2 gate; 0.35 SOL, 5-slot hold / no stop; pre-send shadow (2 h)",
